{"id":"0173e0f8c9568f2f","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-polynomial-string-functions.md","title":"Polynomial-Time Computable Function","display":"df-polynomial-time-computable-function — Polynomial-Time Computable Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-polynomial-string-functions","aliases":["73-df-polynomial-string-functions","73-df-polynomial-time-computable-function"],"display":"df-polynomial-time-computable-function — Polynomial-Time Computable Function","depends_on":["[[73-df-string-function-computation]]","[[73-df-dtm-language-semantics]]","[[73-df-partial-value-conventions]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-polynomial-string-functions"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-polynomial-string-functions</span><span>73-df-polynomial-time-computable-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-polynomial-time-computable-function — Polynomial-Time Computable Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fd9e85296ed6a24d\" href=\"?note=fd9e85296ed6a24d\" title=\"73-df-string-function-computation\">73-df-string-function-computation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"888d8ab66ec7efca\" href=\"?note=888d8ab66ec7efca\" title=\"73-df-dtm-language-semantics\">73-df-dtm-language-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"773cae915e5165f3\" href=\"?note=773cae915e5165f3\" title=\"73-df-partial-value-conventions\">73-df-partial-value-conventions</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf2=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbf2=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathbf2^*\\to\\mathbf2^*\">\\(f:\\mathbf2^*\\to\\mathbf2^*\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\mathbf2}\">\\(M\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\mathbf2}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\mathbf2^*\">\\(w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Computes}_{\\mathbf2,\\mathbf2}\">\\(\\operatorname{Computes}_{\\mathbf2,\\mathbf2}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fd9e85296ed6a24d\" href=\"?note=fd9e85296ed6a24d\" title=\"73-df-string-function-computation\">73-df-string-function-computation</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Conf}_M\">\\(\\operatorname{Conf}_M\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_M^{\\mathsf{init}}\">\\(C_M^{\\mathsf{init}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to_M\">\\(\\to_M\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Halting}_M\">\\(\\operatorname{Halting}_M\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"888d8ab66ec7efca\" href=\"?note=888d8ab66ec7efca\" title=\"73-df-dtm-language-semantics\">73-df-dtm-language-semantics</a> 的同一机器实例。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pmin}\">\\(\\operatorname{pmin}\\)</span> 与收敛记号见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"773cae915e5165f3\" href=\"?note=773cae915e5165f3\" title=\"73-df-partial-value-conventions\">73-df-partial-value-conventions</a>。定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{stime}_M\">\\(\\operatorname{stime}_M\\)</span> 时不预设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 计算任何总函数；该要求仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{FP}\">\\(\\mathsf{FP}\\)</span> 的存在量词内出现。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}time\\text{-}computable\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{stime}_M\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{(w,r)\\in\\mathbf2^*\\times\\mathbb N:\n\\bigl(\\{m\\in\\mathbb N:\\exists\\rho:\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\to\\operatorname{Conf}_M\\;\n(\\rho(0)=C_M^{\\mathsf{init}}(w)\n\\land(\\forall i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}\\;\\rho(i)\\to_M\\rho(i+1))\n\\land\\operatorname{Halting}_M(\\rho(m)))\\},r\\bigr)\\in\\operatorname{pmin}\\Bigr\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{stime}_M:\\mathbf2^*\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}time\\text{-}computable\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{stime}_M\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{(w,r)\\in\\mathbf2^*\\times\\mathbb N:\n\\bigl(\\{m\\in\\mathbb N:\\exists\\rho:\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\to\\operatorname{Conf}_M\\;\n(\\rho(0)=C_M^{\\mathsf{init}}(w)\n\\land(\\forall i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}\\;\\rho(i)\\to_M\\rho(i+1))\n\\land\\operatorname{Halting}_M(\\rho(m)))\\},r\\bigr)\\in\\operatorname{pmin}\\Bigr\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{stime}_M:\\mathbf2^*\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}time\\text{-}computable\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{FP}\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{f:\\mathbf2^*\\to\\mathbf2^*:\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\mathbf2}\\;\\Bigl[\n\\operatorname{Computes}_{\\mathbf2,\\mathbf2}(M,f)\n\\land\\bigl(\\exists k,c\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists n_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;\n(|w|\\ge n_0\\to\\exists r\\in\\mathbb N\\;((w,r)\\in\\operatorname{stime}_M\\land r\\le c|w|^k))\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\Bigr\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}time\\text{-}computable\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{FP}\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{f:\\mathbf2^*\\to\\mathbf2^*:\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\mathbf2}\\;\\Bigl[\n\\operatorname{Computes}_{\\mathbf2,\\mathbf2}(M,f)\n\\land\\bigl(\\exists k,c\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists n_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;\n(|w|\\ge n_0\\to\\exists r\\in\\mathbb N\\;((w,r)\\in\\operatorname{stime}_M\\land r\\le c|w|^k))\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\Bigr\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The same machine both computes the function and satisfies the polynomial bound; this closes the witness mismatch in the former use of an undeclared <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{FP}\">\\(\\mathsf{FP}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-string-function-computation","status":"resolved","id":"fd9e85296ed6a24d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-string-function-computation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dtm-language-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"888d8ab66ec7efca","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dtm-language-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-partial-value-conventions","status":"resolved","id":"773cae915e5165f3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-partial-value-conventions]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-string-function-computation","status":"resolved","id":"fd9e85296ed6a24d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Computes}_{\\mathbf2,\\mathbf2}$ 见 [[73-df-string-function-computation]]；$\\operatorname{Conf}_M$、$C_M^{\\mathsf{init}}$、$\\to_M$、$\\operatorname{Halting}_M$ 使用 [[73-df-dtm-language-semantics]] 的同一机器实例。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dtm-language-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"888d8ab66ec7efca","anchor":"ref-5","t